1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
 Remember light, light, dark for your next outfit.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,020
 And it's super simple.

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,100
 Take all the light colors you have in your closet

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,920
 and all of the dark colors you have in your closet.

5
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,020
 Pick one dark color, two light colors,

6
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,680
 and here are three ways to style it.

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,840
 You could use the sandwich method.

8
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:14,040
 Light shoes, dark pants, light sweater.

9
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,820
 And here's what it looks like with a light gray sweater.

10
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:16,960
 You could go with dark loafers

11
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,160
 and some light pieces on top.

12
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,260
 And here's another way to do it.

13
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,600
 Two light pieces on bottom, one dark sweater on top.

14
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,320
 Or you can even go with an all light outfit,

15
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,880
 but accessorize with a dark bag or even a dark hat.

16
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,100
 Remember light, light, dark.

